	quest.2620A7CCFB446634.quest_subtitle: "As the name implies, Energizing Orb receives electric charge and uses it on items to upgrade machinery. The higher tier the material, the more power required to energize."
	quest.2629BC0942CC42F6.quest_desc: ["&7It has gotten stronger. You can feel that it hasn't reached it's full potential yet. You must keep pushing. Youre far too gone to stop now, right? Cannibalize life."]
