		"Complete every quest in &eThe Vanilla Journey&r to earn the title &bVanilla Legend&r."
		""
		"The title is offered automatically. Choose &a[Accept]&r to wear it under your name – or &c[Decline]&r to keep it in your collection for later."
	]
	quest.48A6AA0ABCD6E3B3.quest_subtitle: "The Vanilla Journey"
	quest.48A6AA0ABCD6E3B3.title: "Vanilla Legend"
	quest.48C30D0DA9ADD1DE.quest_desc: ["The base material of Iron's magic. You will find it in loot chests all over the world – libraries, ruins, the Nether and beyond."]
	quest.48C30D0DA9ADD1DE.title: "Arcane Essence"
	quest.48C89FFF60414299.quest_desc: [
		"Complete every quest in &eCountry Life&r to earn the title &bCountry Legend&r."
