		"The title is offered automatically. Choose &a[Accept]&r to wear it under your name – or &c[Decline]&r to keep it in your collection for later."
	]
	quest.48C89FFF60414299.quest_subtitle: "Country Life"
	quest.48C89FFF60414299.title: "Country Legend"
	quest.48D9A7EE325F0A7A.quest_desc: ["Automatically converts nuggets, ingots and blocks."]
	quest.48DD21A196C2D101.title: "Sapphire Ingot"
	quest.48FB131DF1CF284A.quest_desc: [
		"This pack has a &6lot&r of hotkeys. They have been sorted so nothing important overlaps. The keys below always show &oyour&r current binding."
		""
		"&6&lGeneral"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Open Backpack: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sophisticatedbackpacks.open_backpack\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Curios (accessory slots): \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.curios.open.desc\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Jewelry slots (RPG gear): \"},{\"keybind\":\"accessories.key.open_accessories_screen\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Skill Trees: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.puffish_skills.open\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Ultimine (hold): \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ftbultimine\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Toggle Magnets: \"},{\"keybind\":\"simplemagnets.keys.toggle\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&d&lMagic"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Cast Iron's spell: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.irons_spellbooks.spellbook_cast\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Iron's Spell Wheel (hold): \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.irons_spellbooks.spell_wheel\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Open Ars Nouveau spell book: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ars_nouveau.open_book\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Ars Nouveau spell selection: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ars_nouveau.selection_hud\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Relic abilities (hold): \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.relics.active_abilities_list\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		""
		"&a&lTerraria (Confluence)"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Throw Grappling Hook: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.confluence.hook\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Quick Heal: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.confluence.healing\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Quick Mana: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.confluence.mana\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Summon Mount: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.terra_entity.ride\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&b&lArmor and Gadgets"
		"Armor abilities live on the six-key block above the arrow keys:"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Helmet abilities: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.mekanism.head_mode\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Chestplate / Jetpack: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.mekanism.chest_mode\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Leggings: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.mekanism.legs_mode\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Boots: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.mekanism.feet_mode\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Jetpack hover / armor menus: \"},{\"keybind\":\"keybind.ironjetpacks.hover\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Cataclysm weapon ability: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.cataclysm.ability\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"
		""
		"&7Everything can be changed under Options → Controls → Key Binds (there is a search bar!)."
	]
	quest.48FB131DF1CF284A.quest_subtitle: "A cheat sheet for this pack's hotkeys"
	quest.48FB131DF1CF284A.title: "Know Your Controls"
	quest.492B94F2CC054864.quest_desc: ["Infuse an Upgrade Orb with a school material, then apply it at the Arcane Anvil to boost that school's power on your gear."]
	quest.492B94F2CC054864.title: "Upgrade Orbs"
	quest.497FB5F5849F7912.quest_desc: [
		"Complete every quest in &eLuck and Fun&r to earn the title &bLucky Legend&r."
		""
		"The title is offered automatically. Choose &a[Accept]&r to wear it under your name – or &c[Decline]&r to keep it in your collection for later."
	]
	quest.497FB5F5849F7912.quest_subtitle: "Luck and Fun"
	quest.497FB5F5849F7912.title: "Lucky Legend"
	quest.499506BBA2F2BF14.quest_subtitle: "Thermo Generators use heat sources under them to generate power and use water to cool down. The higher tier, the more power generated from heat."
	quest.49B859D0E181F2D3.quest_desc: ["Completely useless. Completely essential."]
	quest.49B859D0E181F2D3.title: "Whoopee!"
	quest.49FF660487B0E255.quest_desc: ["Netherite gear + Topaz Upgrade Smithing Template + Topaz Ingot at a Smithing Table."]
	quest.49FF660487B0E255.title: "Topaz Upgrade"
	quest.4A308BBCC4A2528E.quest_desc: ["The Spell Binding Table binds class spells to your spell book and weapons."]
	quest.4A421F4B3B629AAE.quest_desc: ["A walking forge of netherite and lava."]
	quest.4A421F4B3B629AAE.title: "Netherite Monstrosity"
	quest.4A584686E5294BBD.quest_desc: ["[\"\",{\"text\":\"Teleport where you look and between Travel Anchors. Hotkey: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.enderio.travel_staff\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"]
	quest.4A6AC0953235E6C3.quest_desc: ["A big modpack means a lot of stuff. This chapter covers storage, handy tools and helpers that save you time."]
	quest.4A6AC0953235E6C3.title: "Tidy Up!"
	quest.4A7A34FC9C13C202.quest_desc: ["Turns the rotation of a windmill or watermill into power."]
	quest.4AED92362B20A166.quest_desc: ["Holystone tools sometimes drop Ambrosium Shards while mining."]
	quest.4AED92362B20A166.title: "Holystone Tools"
	quest.4AF5EC021DF2AFCB.quest_desc: ["Build a hollow cube (3×3×3 up to 5×5×5) out of walls with at least one valve. Items inside are crafted under pressure."]
	quest.4AF5EC021DF2AFCB.title: "Pressure Chamber"
	quest.4B0FFCB41884054E.quest_desc: [
		"&6☀ Sun:&r ores drop already smelted and you dig 25% faster."
		"&b☾ Moon:&r 30% chance for an extra drop from every ore."
		""
		"&7Silk Touch turns both powers off."
	]
	quest.4B0FFCB41884054E.title: "Sunforged Pickaxe"
	quest.4B47AE5288854692.quest_desc: [
		"Your teammates cannot hurt you – no sword swings, arrows, spells, explosions or pets."
		""
		"Want to spar? Switch &cfriendly fire ON&r in the OneDay menu or with &e/oneday friendlyfire on&r. Then your teammates and allies can hit you."
		""
		"&7You can switch only every 5 minutes, so nobody can dodge a fight by flipping it mid-battle. Teams are the FTB Teams parties."
	]
	quest.4B47AE5288854692.title: "Friendly Fire"
	quest.4B5561CDC7383557.quest_desc: ["Fry food on a heat source – or swing it as a surprisingly good weapon!"]
	quest.4BA02609B12588A4.quest_desc: ["Cooked meals restore lots of hunger and give Nourishment or Comfort."]
	quest.4BA02609B12588A4.title: "Chef's Menu"
	quest.4BCE38717F3BD099.quest_desc: ["Mob Grinding Utils: fans, saws, XP taps and absorption hoppers for mob farms."]
	quest.4BCE38717F3BD099.title: "Mob Fan"
	quest.4BD5472344A7B262.quest_desc: [
		"Place it on one of the catalyst spots of the Natural Altar to crush items."
		""
		"Gold Leaf into Gold Powder, Cobblestone into Sand, Bones into extra Bone Meal and more."
	]
	quest.4BE44AF9519BB39E.quest_desc: ["Runewood trees grow in the wild."]
	quest.4C982E8EF38BB712.quest_desc: ["Yellorite Ore generates deep in the Overworld. Smelt it into Yellorium Ingots – the reactor fuel."]
	quest.4C982E8EF38BB712.title: "Yellorium"
	quest.4D1FE64444475355.quest_desc: ["A wither-powered war machine built by a forgotten civilization."]
	quest.4D1FE64444475355.title: "The Harbinger"
	quest.4D2A89CAC18D3CC4.title: "Swampy"
	quest.4D38C6F3D135FA88.quest_desc: [
		"Complete every quest in &eA World of Biomes&r to earn the title &bWorld Traveler&r."
		""
		"The title is offered automatically. Choose &a[Accept]&r to wear it under your name – or &c[Decline]&r to keep it in your collection for later."
	]
	quest.4D38C6F3D135FA88.quest_subtitle: "A World of Biomes"
	quest.4D38C6F3D135FA88.title: "World Traveler"
	quest.4D3E9F88C7B10794.quest_desc: ["Mekanism Extras adds four more tiers: Absolute, Supreme, Cosmic and Infinite."]
	quest.4D3E9F88C7B10794.title: "Absolute Circuit"
	quest.4D792CB7F1B76B0F.quest_desc: [
		"Spot an Owl in a forest."
		""
		"It watches you. It judges you. It hoots."
	]
	quest.4D792CB7F1B76B0F.title: "Hoot Hoot"
	quest.4DA7674300531BAB.quest_desc: ["Put a saddle on a Strider and steer it across lava lakes."]
	quest.4DA7674300531BAB.title: "Lava Surfing"
	quest.4DD812D8096B5BB7.quest_desc: ["&7The only thing that will always follow you, is your Shadow."]
	quest.4DD812D8096B5BB7.quest_subtitle: "&7Like a Bee made out of the absence of light."
	quest.4DDDE27405E9693C.quest_desc: [
		"Complete every quest in &ePotions&r to earn the title &bAlchemist&r."
		""
		"The title is offered automatically. Choose &a[Accept]&r to wear it under your name – or &c[Decline]&r to keep it in your collection for later."
	]
	quest.4DDDE27405E9693C.quest_subtitle: "Potions"
	quest.4DDDE27405E9693C.title: "Alchemist"
	quest.4E0F2BFF1BF61BBC.quest_subtitle: "Thermo Plates are an essential part used to create and upgrade your generators."
	quest.4E2FDDD93B94FAE6.quest_desc: ["Found in the Nether."]
	quest.4E4052F7EAD4FDD6.quest_desc: ["Bright banners and painted walls lure travelers closer, but inside these towering strongholds, chaos reigns. Each floor brims with bandits and traps, their laughter echoing as waves of foes pour from endless spawners. Conquer the towers, and their riches—and notoriety—are yours."]
	quest.4E4052F7EAD4FDD6.quest_subtitle: "Find the Bandit Towers"
	quest.4E7045A51F33FDBF.quest_desc: ["Tier 6 crops only grow on Insanium Farmland – and they also need their &dCrux&r block right underneath the farmland."]
	quest.4E7045A51F33FDBF.title: "Insanium Farmland"
	quest.4EA5D6DD0FC96209.quest_desc: ["The in-game guide. Read it – rituals are precise."]
	quest.4EDDBC0A68DDD41A.quest_desc: ["A sand-bound pharaoh wakes inside the Cursed Pyramid."]
	quest.4EDDBC0A68DDD41A.title: "Ancient Remnant"
	quest.4F047FBEFD53BA67.quest_desc: ["Two Shulker Shells and a chest: a box that keeps its contents when broken."]
	quest.4F16800557328AE3.title: "The Red Planet"
	quest.4F55B39063BFE262.quest_desc: ["An energy-powered suit that lets you fly."]
	quest.4F55B39063BFE262.title: "Jet Suit"
	quest.4F5AB4F25EDF8C39.quest_desc: ["[\"\",{\"text\":\"Research and install cybernetic augments. Augment menu: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.oritech.augment_screen\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"\"}]"]
	quest.4F6B35E986BD5104.quest_desc: [
		"Perform the &6Summon Wilden&r ritual augmented with a Wilden Horn, Spike and Wing to summon the Wilden Chimera."
		""
		"&cWarning:&r the ritual destroys blocks around the brazier. Do it away from your base!"
	]
	quest.4F6B35E986BD5104.title: "The Wilden Chimera"
	quest.4F7470FB16524177.quest_desc: [
		"Five bosses wait in their own structures. Bring friends – and remember that everyone nearby gets a trophy."
		""
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Dodge roll: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.block_factorys_bosses.dodge_roll\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" – you have 2 charges that refill after a short time.\"}]"
	]
	quest.4F7470FB16524177.title: "Bosses' Rise"
	quest.4F94D8D6B7517754.title: "Singular Alloy"
	quest.4F995829046A68BB.quest_desc: [
		"The Environmental Ocular shows twice as much Aura as the Eye and every Aura effect that is happening where you stand."
		""
		"You have mastered Nature's Aura!"
	]
	quest.4F995829046A68BB.quest_subtitle: "The Environmental Ocular"
	quest.4F995829046A68BB.title: "One with Nature"
	quest.4F9BFD9E70F5EF17.quest_desc: ["Smithing Table: Ender Gem + Blank Teleporter + Emerald Ore."]
	quest.4FA8A74408D31C49.quest_desc: [
		"Protect a villager from an unwanted shock without starting a fire."
		""
		"A lightning rod fixes what you broke in the last quest."
	]
	quest.4FA8A74408D31C49.title: "Surge Protector"
	quest.4FAD34583B107D77.quest_desc: ["Big multiblock reactors and turbines. Size and fuel rod layout decide how much power you get."]
	quest.4FAD34583B107D77.title: "Extreme Reactors"
	quest.4FC0AEE825F06123.quest_desc: [
		"Complete every quest in &eApplied Energistics 2&r to earn the title &bAE2 Legend&r."
		""
		"The title is offered automatically. Choose &a[Accept]&r to wear it under your name – or &c[Decline]&r to keep it in your collection for later."
	]
	quest.4FC0AEE825F06123.quest_subtitle: "Applied Energistics 2"
	quest.4FC0AEE825F06123.title: "AE2 Legend"
	quest.4FCF07973444B064.title: "Supremium Gear"
	quest.501B670CACF1CD84.quest_subtitle: "Dielectric Casing is a material that is required on all machinery to function as they always contain one in each recipe and upgrade."
	quest.501B670CACF1CD84.title: "Heart of the Machine"
	quest.502AC69F40F645CA.quest_desc: ["Infuse a Gold Ingot on the Natural Altar."]
	quest.503753E6E4E33AD6.quest_desc: [
		"Right-click the Savings Pig with coins or emeralds to save them. It keeps your savings when you break it."
		""
		"Sneak + empty hand shakes everything out again – already sorted into the biggest coins."
	]
	quest.503753E6E4E33AD6.title: "Oink!"
	quest.503BDDD3F75B761E.quest_desc: ["Eggs hide in temple, stronghold, fortress, dungeon, igloo and buried treasure chests. Wild dragons also roam the world."]
	quest.503BDDD3F75B761E.title: "A Dragon Egg"
	quest.508A68D4C7383920.quest_desc: ["&7Do you really want a night without any confirmation that you're not alone? Fine. Have it your way."]
	quest.508A68D4C7383920.quest_subtitle: "To kill the stars."
	quest.5092A4CFE00F712B.quest_desc: [
		"Die 100 times."
		""
		"At this point you are basically a ghost with a hobby."
	]
	quest.5092A4CFE00F712B.title: "Death Is Just a Suggestion"
	quest.50959AAA8316BD39.quest_desc: ["Guardian of the Ocean Monuments. Bring Water Breathing and milk."]
	quest.50959AAA8316BD39.title: "Elder Guardian"
	quest.509E9CA83FBC780E.quest_subtitle: "Find a Fishing Hut"
	quest.50F463BAC456114B.quest_desc: ["A colossal, lava-covered titan. Bring fire resistance and a lot of courage."]
	quest.50F463BAC456114B.title: "Luxtructosaurus"
	quest.5100CFAD43E7D67A.quest_desc: ["Rising like a monument to conquest, this sprawling fortress serves as a bastion of Illager power. Its many levels are patrolled by raiders and spellcasters, their banners declaring dominion over the land. Within its halls lie chambers of wealth, guarded by Evokers whose magic is as deadly as their stares."]
	quest.5100CFAD43E7D67A.quest_subtitle: "Find an Illager Fort"
	quest.515210305D347C36.quest_desc: ["Capture a mob's soul."]
	quest.518BCF32EB0AC4E9.quest_desc: [
		"This world is full of bosses. This chapter tracks the big ones outside of the other dimension chapters."
		""
		"Bosses scale with Apotheosis World Tiers – bring friends, potions and your best gear."
	]
	quest.518BCF32EB0AC4E9.title: "Hunter's Oath"
	quest.518F878DE52A0567.quest_desc: [
		"Jump 50,000 times."
		""
		"At this point walking is just a rumour to you."
	]
	quest.518F878DE52A0567.title: "Human Kangaroo"
	quest.51A53B4AD00DEFC7.title: "Vein Goblin"
	quest.51DFCE293287D77A.quest_desc: ["Opens an Ender Chest frequency from your pocket."]
	quest.51E1B2B885F03F65.quest_desc: ["Faster furnaces, compact villager blocks and other conveniences."]
	quest.51E1B2B885F03F65.title: "Helpers"
	quest.5209EC117C51D5D5.quest_desc: ["&7Ever so learning. Ever so studying. All these things knew was taught. Their only instinct was to learn."]
	quest.5209EC117C51D5D5.quest_subtitle: "&7They werent many. But their Eyes were."
	quest.52A14B3BFC213EE7.quest_desc: [
		"Catch an axolotl in a bucket."
		""
		"It smiles while it hunts. Adorable and terrifying."
	]
	quest.52A14B3BFC213EE7.title: "The Cutest Predator"
	quest.52B365E69F91757C.quest_desc: ["Upgrade diamond gear to netherite at a Smithing Table."]
	quest.52B365E69F91757C.title: "Netherite Warrior"
	quest.5346F22DCB47099E.title: "Crag Gardens"
	quest.5380B43AFD30C6C2.quest_desc: ["Dimension Expansion adds extra mining dimensions. They all start with a Blank Teleporter: Chiseled Deepslate, Calibrated Sculk Sensors, a Sculk Catalyst, a Sculk Shrieker and a Netherite Pickaxe."]
	quest.53AF2B722A69DCDC.quest_desc: ["Tucked away in the tall grass, this lonely house stands weathered and broken, its timbers groaning with age. Easy to overlook, it bears little more than the memory of those who once called it home. Still, even the smallest refuge can hold a story."]
	quest.53AF2B722A69DCDC.quest_subtitle: "Find a Small Prairie House"
	quest.53B32DDC23F390C6.quest_desc: [
		"Jump 10,000 times."
		""
		"Your knees have filed a complaint."
	]
	quest.53B32DDC23F390C6.title: "Pogo Stick"
	quest.541BBC35DA4F0B73.quest_desc: ["Sprouting from a cluster of towering fungi, this outpost of miners has carved their livelihood into the surface world. Ruthless and territorial, they will defend their claim with tooth and nail. Whether the giant mushrooms shield them from the sun or serve some darker purpose, none can say. One truth remains certain: the mine runs rich with ore, for those bold enough to claim it."]
	quest.541BBC35DA4F0B73.quest_subtitle: "Find a Mushroom Mine"
	quest.542AD63BDCE75C48.quest_desc: ["A cursed ship out on the ocean."]
	quest.542AD63BDCE75C48.title: "Kraken Ship"
	quest.54742CC8D5AFB79C.quest_desc: ["Hat bags hold random cosmetic hats. Fashion is survival too."]
	quest.5476839FBC0F0BB3.quest_desc: ["The encyclopedia of cave biomes. Each Cave Codex you read adds new pages."]
	quest.5476839FBC0F0BB3.title: "Cave Compendium"
	quest.547DCAE28B3968ED.quest_desc: [
		"&7Walls have ears."
		"&7Doors have eyes."
		"&7Trees have voices."
		"&7Beasts tell lies."
		"&7Beware the rain."
		"&7Beware the snow."
		"&7Beware the man."
		"&7You think you know."
	]
	quest.547DCAE28B3968ED.quest_subtitle: "Guilt can consume you from within."
	quest.54A18E7973F870B7.quest_desc: ["&7Which one do you dread more, the Echo or the answer. Howl your Melancholic Question."]
	quest.54A18E7973F870B7.quest_subtitle: "Oh tell me Great One"
	quest.54DDD41865E22FC3.quest_desc: ["Every creature releases different kinds of spirits."]
	quest.54DDD41865E22FC3.title: "Spirits"
	quest.54EDC59229EEEAC9.quest_desc: [
		"Oney is the OneDay mascot: half sun, half moon, all love."
		""
		"Pat it for a squeak – or right-click in the air to &ewear it as a hat&r!"
	]
	quest.54EDC59229EEEAC9.title: "Say Hi to Oney!"
	quest.5517CAD006FC35F7.quest_desc: ["Craft this Eye and throw it like an Eye of Ender – it flies towards the &6Cursed Pyramid&r."]
	quest.5517CAD006FC35F7.title: "Find the Cursed Pyramid"
	quest.556AA138630CFF71.quest_desc: [
		"Craft this Eye and throw it like an Eye of Ender – it flies towards the &6Ruined Citadel&r."
		"It is found in the End."
	]
	quest.556AA138630CFF71.title: "Find the Ruined Citadel"
	quest.556C78463DB00269.quest_desc: ["&7There is a Encryption on this Weapon by one of its previous Wielders. You can make out the first two letters. \"Br-\". The handle still oozes with a heat you wouldn't expect from such a oddly cold weapon. While holding it you feel as if someone made a joke a couple hundred times too much."]
	quest.556C78463DB00269.quest_subtitle: "Some things are enough said once."
	quest.55ED54B1E7CE395A.quest_desc: ["Adds a socket to an item at the Smithing Table."]
	quest.55F6BA6CDE92815A.title: "Ruby Ring"
	quest.56165119F5F61BA6.quest_desc: ["Doubles ores into dusts."]
	quest.56165119F5F61BA6.title: "Crusher"
	quest.56246F75390FA413.quest_desc: ["Precise shots from afar – and spears for close combat."]
	quest.56246F75390FA413.title: "Archer"
	quest.56587141383612EF.quest_desc: ["The blind terror of the Ancient Cities. Killing it is optional – surviving is not."]
	quest.56587141383612EF.title: "The Warden"
	quest.566A74C179C5FBF1.title: "Allthemodium Ingot"
	quest.566AF1014C71F49E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mekanism&r is a huge tech mod: ore processing that multiplies your ores up to 5x, powerful machines, jetpacks, a Digital Miner and eventually fission and fusion reactors."
		""
		"Everything starts with &bOsmium&r. Find some Osmium Ore underground and mine it."
	]
	quest.566AF1014C71F49E.quest_subtitle: "Machines, chemistry and nuclear power"
	quest.566AF1014C71F49E.title: "Welcome to Mekanism"
	quest.568FFFCB09BC501B.quest_desc: ["A flying sea serpent that nests on coastal cliffs."]
	quest.568FFFCB09BC501B.title: "Naga"
	quest.5693BC4E9BB3E889.quest_desc: ["A world of solid stone to tunnel through."]
	quest.5693BC4E9BB3E889.title: "Solid Stone"
	quest.569A5F59A2F4806E.title: "Extended Interface"
	quest.56CB8A0314031460.quest_desc: [
		"Complete every quest in &eAlex's Caves&r to earn the title &bCave Legend&r."
		""
		"The title is offered automatically. Choose &a[Accept]&r to wear it under your name – or &c[Decline]&r to keep it in your collection for later."
	]
	quest.56CB8A0314031460.quest_subtitle: "Alex's Caves"
	quest.56CB8A0314031460.title: "Cave Legend"
	quest.56D4107853E10AF2.quest_desc: ["Charges items – and zaps anything that comes too close."]
	quest.56D4107853E10AF2.title: "Tesla Coil"
