		"Right-click farmland with an essence to turn it into Essence Farmland of that tier."
		""
		"In OneDay resource crops &conly grow&r on Farmland of their own tier!"
	]
	quest.59CC9FF3A8AB5F1B.title: "Effective Farmland"
	quest.59F4E4A9A9F511F4.quest_desc: ["Coffee gives you potion effects. Not a joke!"]
	quest.59F4E4A9A9F511F4.title: "Coffee Break"
	quest.5A167806CBF28D9F.quest_desc: ["Summon a Foliot that chops trees for you."]
	quest.5A25A92FF0474D5A.quest_desc: [
		"Complete every quest in &eBosses' Rise&r to earn the title &bDragon Slayer&r."
		""
		"The title is offered automatically. Choose &a[Accept]&r to wear it under your name – or &c[Decline]&r to keep it in your collection for later."
	]
	quest.5A25A92FF0474D5A.quest_subtitle: "Bosses' Rise"
	quest.5A25A92FF0474D5A.title: "Dragon Slayer"
	quest.5A3AAF71A540058D.quest_desc: ["Changed your mind? This orb resets your skill points."]
	quest.5A8C3A60C0361E16.title: "Jade"
	quest.5A9BAB15C4C8791F.quest_desc: ["A multiblock crafting CPU with huge storage and many parallel jobs."]
	quest.5A9BAB15C4C8791F.title: "Quantum Computer"
	quest.5AA2A1E358A18B4E.quest_desc: [
		"&c&lEmpowered Remnants&r &7are created by melting down unique weapons."
		""
		"&7They are used in the creation of &9&lRunefused Gems&r, &7and &6&lNetherfused Gems&r."
	]
	quest.5AA2A1E358A18B4E.quest_subtitle: "A Pain to Make..."
	quest.5AC50DF4F52A548F.quest_desc: ["&7The records were well kept, but the nature of these weapons makes everything decay with time. Noone really knows where these came from or who made them, what we know is that when you see someone wield these, they are most likely doomed to fail."]
	quest.5AC50DF4F52A548F.quest_subtitle: "&7They came flying from a sky we couldnt even percieve."
	quest.5B0595FA1A96061C.title: "Subatomic Alloy"
	quest.5B0EC9A80C44CF6F.quest_desc: ["Made from Polished Rose Quartz and an Iron Sheet. Many advanced machines need them."]
	quest.5B0EC9A80C44CF6F.title: "Electron Tube"
	quest.5B267B7674F91DE8.quest_desc: ["&7Like a Magnet for Souls. Loves sewing them together as if they were Fabric. "]
	quest.5B267B7674F91DE8.quest_subtitle: "&7An agglomeration of Souls"
	quest.5B385756792DF818.quest_desc: [
		"Take a Strider for a long ride on a lava lake in the Overworld."
		""
		"Tourism, but make it hot."
	]
	quest.5B385756792DF818.title: "Feels Like Home"
	quest.5B3FAB0E6063E784.title: "Undead Miner"
	quest.5B72BBC553D0B2FF.quest_desc: ["Craft this Eye and throw it like an Eye of Ender – it flies towards the &6Frosted Prison&r."]
	quest.5B72BBC553D0B2FF.title: "Find the Frosted Prison"
	quest.5B8501629AEE9254.quest_desc: ["Assembles complex parts like Processing Units."]
	quest.5B8F694F41090641.quest_desc: ["&7There is a charm about the forbidden that makes it unspeakably desirable."]
	quest.5B8F694F41090641.quest_subtitle: "It stings, just holding it. Wonder what that blade will do."
	quest.5B978E6C5FE55BEB.quest_subtitle: "An exclusive ingredient used to create Player Transmitters."
	quest.5BDF827CD85D6D18.title: "Bayou"
	quest.5C12F4CC1F6F6C32.quest_desc: ["Looming among the clouds, this massive airship bristles with defenses and hostile crew. Phantom-mounted fiends circle overhead, while fish-like raiders astride hoglins stalk the decks. Boarding it is no small feat. Tthose who triumph will etch their name among the few who dared challenge the skies."]
	quest.5C12F4CC1F6F6C32.quest_subtitle: "Find a Heavenly Challenger"
	quest.5C498C29711B93B9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Ars Nouveau&r lets you build your own spells out of glyphs: a &eForm&r (how it is cast), &eEffects&r (what it does) and &eAugments&r (how strongly)."
		""
		"Craft the Worn Notebook (Book + Lapis) – it is the complete in-game guide."
	]
	quest.5C498C29711B93B9.title: "The Worn Notebook"
	quest.5C6755620140F16B.quest_desc: ["&7Whoever wielded this, didnt make it long. How will you fare against yourself? The Blades is as disgusting as it is sharp. The Blade's inscription tells that the Title of Plaguelord was bestowed upon the poor soul that accepted it."]
	quest.5C6755620140F16B.quest_subtitle: "Do you feel Diseased?"
	quest.5C76D4569C11F1ED.title: "Iceologer"
	quest.5C78BBC3403DFB6F.quest_subtitle: "This Binding Card will allow wireless charging across dimensions, but must use a binding card on an Enderman to work."
	quest.5C78BBC3403DFB6F.title: "Bounded Through Dimensions"
	quest.5C84B23A30184926.quest_desc: ["Burns solid fuel to make power."]
	quest.5C8B7182A48F5825.quest_desc: ["Combine 4 essences of one tier with the crystal to get 1 essence of the next tier."]
	quest.5C8B7182A48F5825.title: "Infusion Crystal"
	quest.5CA50A078D1A5E39.quest_desc: ["A Glass Bottle and any Planks. Used to collect Aura straight out of the air."]
