		"Complete every quest in &eEpic Knights&r to earn the title &bKnight Errant&r."
		""
		"The title is offered automatically. Choose &a[Accept]&r to wear it under your name – or &c[Decline]&r to keep it in your collection for later."
	]
	quest.5CE1F4027F094B5E.quest_subtitle: "Epic Knights"
	quest.5CE1F4027F094B5E.title: "Knight Errant"
	quest.5CEB4D920E2DCACB.quest_desc: [
		"Right-click the air with a Bottle and Cork in the Overworld."
		""
		"In the Nether you get &cBottled Ghosts&r, in the End &5Bottled Darkness&r. A Dispenser with Bottles and Corks collects it for you."
	]
	quest.5CEB4D920E2DCACB.title: "Bottled Sunlight"
	quest.5CF1C9D38D56C0AD.quest_desc: ["Malum is about the spirits that leave creatures when they die. Its encyclopedia explains everything."]
	quest.5D24AF01CE6F6405.quest_desc: ["A large multiblock that doubles ore output. The manual shows the layout."]
	quest.5D24AF01CE6F6405.title: "Crusher"
	quest.5D24E3F0D7BAC45F.title: "Concussion Creeper"
	quest.5D419B241DD31D4F.quest_desc: [
		"Ring a bell 50 times."
		""
		"The whole village loves you. Definitely. Absolutely."
	]
	quest.5D419B241DD31D4F.title: "Ding Dong Ditch"
	quest.5D95CD051238DEC7.quest_desc: [
		"Terraria NPCs such as the Guide and the Merchant only move in when there is a proper house for them."
		""
		"Build a small house with walls, a door, a light source, a table and a chair. The &6🏠 Town NPCs&r chapter shows who can move in."
	]
	quest.5D95CD051238DEC7.quest_subtitle: "Build a place for your first NPCs"
	quest.5D95CD051238DEC7.title: "Home Sweet Home"
