		"Complete every quest in &eIndustrial Foregoing&r to earn the title &bIndustrial Legend&r."
		""
		"The title is offered automatically. Choose &a[Accept]&r to wear it under your name – or &c[Decline]&r to keep it in your collection for later."
	]
	quest.738488F09895F017.quest_subtitle: "Industrial Foregoing"
	quest.738488F09895F017.title: "Industrial Legend"
	quest.73ACDE3764FEC57D.quest_desc: ["The Wither sometimes drops a &8Withering Soul&r. Three of them craft into Wither Skeleton Skulls – for the next Wither."]
	quest.73ACDE3764FEC57D.title: "Withering Soul"
	quest.73D5EE5238C37982.quest_desc: ["In the wilds rests the skeletal form of a great creature. its skeleton stretching skyward like branches of pale bone. Whether a relic of forgotten myth or a beast once hunted to extinction, none can say. Its silent frame endures as a monument to creatures long lost."]
	quest.73D5EE5238C37982.quest_subtitle: "Find a Ceryneian Hind"
	quest.741BFBD38C8EF8B4.quest_desc: [
		"Crush Gold Leaf in a crafting grid."
		""
		"Gold Powder is placed on the ground to draw the pattern of the Ritual of the Forest."
	]
	quest.74281B45B88EC96C.quest_desc: ["Turns spare seeds back into essence."]
	quest.74281B45B88EC96C.title: "Seed Reprocessor"
	quest.742C90C16A61E36A.quest_desc: ["Collect the dragon's breath in a Glass Bottle to brew lingering potions."]
	quest.7439A83EED6A9A7A.quest_desc: ["A spirit that mines ores from another dimension inside a Dimensional Mineshaft."]
	quest.744B14EA1C1AA63F.quest_desc: ["Places whole rows, walls and floors at once, powered by energy."]
	quest.747523A8C5DCF62D.quest_desc: ["Diamonds hide deep underground and become more common the closer you get to the bottom of the world."]
	quest.747523A8C5DCF62D.title: "Diamonds!"
	quest.75245F21D946DC53.quest_desc: ["Ancient Debris hides deep in the Nether and is immune to lava."]
	quest.7547721B08FA48DB.title: "Autumnal Maple Forest"
	quest.7553E9755A3649D4.title: "Mushroom Creeper"
	quest.7584747C52E6CA67.quest_desc: ["The Ritual Brazier activates Ritual Tablets – from changing the weather to summoning monsters."]
	quest.7584747C52E6CA67.title: "Rituals"
	quest.75E11761F6BF6378.quest_desc: [
		"All six cores on the altar, a Nether Star in your hand – and the whole server will know what you did."
		""
		"Now finish every quest to become a &6OneDay Legend&r (see the Hall of Legends)."
	]
	quest.75E11761F6BF6378.title: "The OneDay Star"
	quest.7616DC9AD47DE1C3.quest_desc: [
		"Craft this Eye and throw it like an Eye of Ender – it flies towards the &6Burning Arena&r."
		"It lies somewhere in the Nether."
	]
	quest.7616DC9AD47DE1C3.title: "Find the Burning Arena"
	quest.761B9A10EA2161C1.quest_subtitle: "Photoelectric Panes are used to create Solar Panels."
	quest.76240B553AD80B03.quest_desc: ["Converts wind into rotation. Needs space around it."]
	quest.7650D83064E7D058.title: "Topaz"
	quest.765DC40E142BBE84.quest_desc: ["Milk plus Rennet in the Cheese Press slowly becomes a Cheese Wheel."]
	quest.768946CEE4820AA0.quest_desc: ["Burns fuel for energy."]
	quest.768D429DF69F48DE.quest_subtitle: "4th Tier Capacitors used to upgrade to Niotic Machinery."
	quest.769A48411FD3EDF8.quest_desc: [
		"Complete every quest in &eAE2 Expansions&r to earn the title &bNetwork Architect&r."
		""
		"The title is offered automatically. Choose &a[Accept]&r to wear it under your name – or &c[Decline]&r to keep it in your collection for later."
	]
	quest.769A48411FD3EDF8.quest_subtitle: "AE2 Expansions"
	quest.769A48411FD3EDF8.title: "Network Architect"
	quest.76BDF1EAA5628971.quest_desc: ["Holds four times as many patterns."]
	quest.76BDF1EAA5628971.title: "Extended Pattern Provider"
	quest.76DA0D5D1368F967.quest_desc: [
		"Soul Stained Steel, Legendary Ink, a Wilden Tribute and Iesnium around an Eclipse Ingot."
		""
		"Title: &dArcane Legend"
	]
	quest.76DA0D5D1368F967.title: "Arcane Core"
	quest.76DAECF378BA3F19.quest_desc: ["Far beneath the surface lies a labyrinth of rails and tunnels, carved by long-forgotten hands. The air is thick with dust and danger. Creatures lurk in the shadows, and the echoes of minecarts rattle through the dark. Yet for those who endure, veins of treasure and hidden chambers make the descent worthwhile."]
	quest.76DAECF378BA3F19.quest_subtitle: "Find a Mining System"
	quest.771507AA08194DE6.quest_desc: [
		"&7This is quite the Task. Many of these Weapons will be crucial for your upcoming Battles. The Scriptures are very in depth, but you dont recognize all names just yet."
		""
		""
		"You can find these weapons in many ways. After some calculations from the old book you deduct the following Chances:"
		"&6Wither 15%"
		"&6Ender Dragon 35%"
		"&6Night Lich 30%"
		"&6Nether Gauntlet 25%"
		"&6Obsidilith 40%"
		"&6Magus 27%"
		"&6Conjunctivius 15%"
		"&6Decaying King 15%"
		"&6Null 20%&r"
	]
	quest.771507AA08194DE6.quest_subtitle: "Collect the Rest of the Uniques!"
	quest.771507AA08194DE6.title: "&l&bRunic Overload..."
	quest.771C4C17592D5909.quest_desc: ["A curio that increases your maximum mana."]
	quest.771C4C17592D5909.title: "Mana Ring"
	quest.77347E1941D87405.quest_desc: [
